[00:00.00] 作词 : David Gilmour/Polly Samson
[00:00.00] 作曲 : David Gilmour
[00:00.00]
[00:03.29]On the day the wall came down
[00:03.29]在这一天迷墙倒塌
[00:07.23]They threw the locks
[00:07.23]他们纷纷将锁链
[00:09.32]Onto the ground
[00:09.32]掷于地上
[00:11.48]And with glasses high
[00:11.48]玻璃大楼高耸入云
[00:13.74]We raised a cry for
[00:13.74]我们大声疾呼
[00:16.23]Freedom had arrived
[00:16.23]自由已经降临
[00:20.69]On the day the wall came down
[00:20.69]在这一天迷墙已然倒塌
[00:24.85]The ship of fools
[00:24.85]愚人船
[00:26.87]Had finally ran aground
[00:26.87]最后终于搁浅
[00:29.46]Promises lit up the night
[00:29.46]承诺点亮了黑夜
[00:33.28]Like paper doves in flight
[00:33.28]像船舱内的纸鸽般
[00:37.89]I dreamed you had left my side
[00:37.89]我梦到你已经离我而去
[00:42.62]No warmth not even pride remained
[00:42.62]温情不再 骄傲也一点不剩
[00:55.22]And even though you needed me
[00:55.22]即便你仍需要我
[00:59.62]It was clear that
[00:59.62]显而易见
[01:01.76]I could not do a thing for you
[01:01.76]我不会再为你做任何事
[01:12.65]Now life devalues day by day
[01:12.65]现在生命一天天贬值殆尽
[01:17.23]As friends and neighbors turn away
[01:17.23]亲朋近邻纷纷离去
[01:21.33]And there's a change that
[01:21.33]一切都变了
[01:23.13]Even with regret cannot be undone
[01:23.13]即便心存遗憾 也已成定局
[01:30.18]Now frontiers shift
[01:30.18]现在边境交替变迁
[01:32.44]Like desert sands
[01:32.44]像沙漠般
[01:34.68]While nations wash
[01:34.68]当帝国统治者洗净
[01:36.82]Their bloodied hands
[01:36.82]他们沾满鲜血的双手
[01:38.90]Of loyalty of history
[01:38.90]皇室贵族连同历史一道
[01:43.34]In shades of grey
[01:43.34]沦为灰色阴影
[01:47.80]I woke to the sound of drums
[01:47.80]我被战鼓声惊醒
[01:51.90]The music played
[01:51.90]音乐响动
[01:54.09]The morning sun streamed in you
[01:54.09]晨光流动
[02:04.86]I turned and I looked at you
[02:04.86]我转过身看到了你
[02:09.22]And all but the bitter residues
[02:09.22]除了残存的苦痛
[02:13.59]Slipped away slipped away
[02:13.59]一切都已消失殆尽 消失殆尽
